# Terraform state can contain secrets (DB password, JWT secret) — never commit it.
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/crash.log
**/*.tfplan

# Personal overrides
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json

# SSH private keys — never commit. Generated by terraform; re-export with
# `terraform output -raw ssh_private_key > labresults-dev-key.pem`
**/*.pem

# tfvars can hold env-specific config/secrets — ignore (path is relative to infra/)
**/terraform.tfvars